#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Worker tuning is done via `TASK_WORKER_*` environment variables. All of "
"them have sane defaults for local development — set them in production as"
" needed."
msgstr ""
"O ajuste do worker é feito via variáveis de ambiente `TASK_WORKER_*`. "
"Todas têm valores padrão razoáveis para desenvolvimento local — configure-"
"as em produção conforme necessário."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variável"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Padrão"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Finalidade"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Threads processing tasks in parallel."
msgstr "Threads processando tarefas em paralelo."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"A task stuck `RUNNING` (worker crash/OOM) is recovered to `READY` after "
"this many minutes."
msgstr ""
"Uma tarefa presa em `RUNNING` (crash/OOM do worker) é recuperada para "
"`READY` depois desses minutos."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`30`"
msgstr "`30`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base delay for exponential backoff between retries."
msgstr "Delay base do backoff exponencial entre retentativas."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Fallback polling interval while waiting on `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (covers "
"deferred tasks whose `run_after` has just elapsed)."
msgstr ""
"Intervalo de polling de reserva enquanto se espera em `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` "
"(cobre tarefas adiadas cujo `run_after` acabou de vencer sem um `NOTIFY` "
"novo)."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"default\"`"
msgstr "`\"default\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Which `DATABASES` alias the worker connects through. Point this at a "
"separate alias (with its own pool sized for `TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + "
"1`) if you don't want the worker sharing a connection pool with your web "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Qual alias de `DATABASES` o worker usa para se conectar. Aponte isso para "
"um alias separado (com seu próprio pool dimensionado para "
"`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + 1`) se você não quiser que o worker "
"compartilhe o connection pool com o processo web."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"django_task_psql\"`"
msgstr "`\"django_task_psql\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Prefix for OpenTelemetry span names (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Only "
"relevant if the `otel` extra is installed."
msgstr ""
"Prefixo para os nomes dos spans do OpenTelemetry "
"(`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Só é relevante se o extra `otel` estiver "
"instalado."

#: ../../configuration.md:14
msgid ""
"A CLI flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) always overrides its "
"corresponding environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Uma flag de CLI (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) sempre tem prioridade sobre "
"a variável de ambiente correspondente."
